window.products.push({"id":786011,"name":"Wall Mount Hair Tool Organizer, Hair Care Product Beauty Supply Station Hot Holder for Blow Dryer, Curling Iron, Straightener, Brush Stand - Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81klGz8h1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No More Mess - Keep your hairdryer and hot appliance tools organized with the Hair Tool Organizer caddy. This wall-mounted holder tray is an accessory that helps you and your family stay tidy with storage for curling irons, blow dryers, hairbrushes, styling products, hair bands, or makeup station Stay Organized Easily - With the large Hair Tool Organizer, you can have an easy and convenient way to keep your bathroom tidy. The wall mount makes installation fast, secure, and simple. Plus, the included towel bar hanger can be installed or left off for counter use Attractive & Durable - With a stylish and unique floral design for women, the white Hair Tool Organizers are designed to fit in any bathroom or bedroom desk and decor. The holder is made with a durable wood material with fine laser-cut detail. The set is completed with a towel rack used for hanging hair or another salon styler utensil Save Space - The Hair Tool Organizer allows you to store your styling tools while still keeping your space neat and organized. This way, there is no need to clutter up countertops or cabinets and take up valuable space in the bathroom. Easier to reach than under the sink or in a drawer Heat Resistant - The holder has heat-resistant stainless steel cups, so you don't have to worry about heat damage or melting. Plus, the holder is made for use with all types of hair tools, hair styling tools, hairbrushes, and hairdryers. Keep your supplies accessible in the bedroom, any counter or wall shelf No More Mess Organization - Keep your hairdryer and hot appliance tools organized with the Hair Tool Organizer caddy. This wall-mounted holder tray is an accessory that helps you and your family stay tidy with storage for curling irons, blow dryers, hairCup and Compartment Dimensions - The cup diameter is 3.55in (90mm) cup height 4.92in (125mm). The 2 side square pocket dimensions are 3.50x5.51in (89x140mm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81klGz8h1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRATEHILL","source_asin":"B0BGYJF9PP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGYJF9PP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGYJF9PP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":786012,"name":"Table Skirt for Rectangular Tables 6ft - Spandex Table Covers for Standard 6 Foot Table - One Piece Fitted Elastic Tablecloth - Wrinkle Resistant Ruff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SlbOMf3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique spandex tablecloths with perfect fitting are the best choice to fulfill all your indoor and outdoor table decoration needs. Transform your tables into elegant party tablescapes by swathing with these spandex table covers 6ft. The ruffles add an elegant touch! Our 6-foot fitted tablecloth is designed to fit snugly on 6-foot rectangular banquet tables. The blend of polyester and spandex material will not only spruce your Party tables up, but is sturdy and durable enough to withstand the heavy duty usage during outdoor carnivals, culinary events, weddings, as well as indoor tea parties, birthdays, and holiday dinners. Fitted spandex tablecloths are made to allow easy access to catering equipment stored beneath the table. Features of the 6ft Spandex Table Cloth: Super easy to place Super easy to place Durable and reusable tablecloth Durable and reusable tablecloth Great for windy weather - tablecloth is never blown off Great for windy weather - tablecloth is never blown off Looks amazing right out of the bag Looks amazing right out of the bag Wrinkle free Wrinkle free Stretching Tablecloth 2 in 1. Covers top & all 4 sides Stretching Tablecloth 2 in 1. Covers top & all 4 sides Care Instruction: These table covers are machine washable in cold water only. Do not bleach. Do not iron. No need for ironing as it stretches on its own. You can spray ruffled bottoms with water...and they will hung better and look fantastic making elegant ruffles. Also, you can steam it in case of need. Usage Reccomendations: The 6 foot fitted tablecloth is measures 30 inches wide x 72 inches long x 29 inches tall, it will only fit that table size. You should not use it on an 8 or 12 foot table, as it would be too small and would not fit. Can be used on a variety of tabletops, including 6ft dining room tables, coffee tables, picnic tables, etc. Order a Spandex Tablecloth for Rectangular Table 6 foot today and give your party or event new fresh and elegant look!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SlbOMf3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Destination","source_asin":"B0C359D5YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C359D5YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C359D5YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
