window.products.push({"id":786145,"name":"Fast Accurate Digital Food Thermometer Folding Auto Switch Meat Thermometer for Grill,BBQ,Oven,Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ubotBNnUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No more overcooked,No more undercooked,Far away from food borne illnesses,Get close to health,Enjoy your perfect delicious food. In the modern life,it becomes more and more important to ensure what temperature food are cooked or served at to prevent possible food borne illnesses.For making sure that food are cooked thoroughly,but not overcook,using a thermometer to accurately measure them which becomes a daily behavior. Easdaily BBQ Digital Thermometer is a new folding auto-switch thermometer in this second half year. It is made of high quality food-safe ABS plastic case and stainless probe.It is very easy to use that to fold for switch-on/off when you open/close the probe.  With a thin and sharp probe to easily insert into meats,such as beef,chicken,large picnic ham or turkey. It takes to read the temperature is fairly quick,only a couple of seconds to get your perfect doneness accurating temperature results with LCD instant read display. The thermometer is portable and easy access.Whether you take it to the patio to check on bbq,or using it in the kitchen when cooking or baking,wich it is easy to hold onto.There is a magnet on the back so you can stick on stove or fridge,also can attach it close to where you need in the kitchen.No more digging through drawers.Also,the folding handle to hide the sharp point which prevents damage or injury when store.The HOLD button on the handle enable to save the temperature until thermometer can be read and not lose what was recorded. It can be changed from F to C by opening the battery compartment and changing the setting,if you'd like. Every time you grill or cook,enjoy the perfect doneness food without burnt or undercooked.  Measuring rang:-58℉~572℉(-50℃~300℃) Battery:1pc AAA battery No operation for 10 minutes auto-off. Package:1 Theremometer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ubotBNnUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easdaily","source_asin":"B015XMGEH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015XMGEH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015XMGEH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
