window.products.push({"id":786239,"name":"InnFast Digital Waterproof Freezer Thermometer with Hook and Large LCD Display, Max/Min Function - Perfect for Fridge, Freezer or General Rooms(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B24amgFOL._SL1280_.jpg","description":"Description: friendly design digital freezer thermometer help avoid food spoilage with a thermometer in your refrigerator and freezer. Max/Min temperature value display on LCD screen; stand for shelf or hang with hook. How to replace the battery: Replace the battery when the reading becomes erratic or the display clarity fades. Open the screw and the ABS shell, and replace with a new CR2032 battery which you can easily get from store. Operations: Press the button to switch on or turn off the instrument. Press °C / °F button to switch between Centigrade and Fahrenheit. Press the button to clear/reset the MIN/MAX readings. Specification: measuring temperature range: -20°C to 50°C/-4°F to 122°F Accuracy: ±1°C/±2°F resolution: 0.1°C/0.2°F waterproof structure, level IPX3 operating voltage: 3V, CR2032 battery, 1PCS Dimensions:8.7 X 1.2 X 4.5 cm/3.4 x 0.5 x 1.8 inch Weight: 45.4g Notes: * Press the CLR button, the MIN/MAX readings will be reset. * Please reboot it if you find inaccurate info. * Please do not leave it in the frozen layer in case of it quit working. Package included: 1 X user manual 1 X Digital Refrigerator Thermometer (battery included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B24amgFOL._SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InnFast","source_asin":"B01IF5D8V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IF5D8V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IF5D8V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
