window.products.push({"id":786272,"name":"Tactical Lunch Box for Men, Insulated Lunch Bag Adult,Leakproof Lunchbox Waterproof Lunch Cooler Bag, Black Thermal Lunch Tote with Adjustable Shoulde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719vl2PM85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Insulated, Cooler, Waterproof, Leak Proof]This lunch bag for men has good heat preservation and refrigeration functions because it uses thickened pearl cotton and aluminum film of hot pressing process. The aluminum film can not only make the mens lunch box leak proof, but also easy to clean. 900D Oxford cloth is added to this lunch box for men heavy duty. The high quality oxford material makes adult lunch box durable. Oxford material also has a waterproof function, so you don't have to worry about water seeping into the insulated lunch box. [Large Capacity]Our large lunch bag demensions is 10*10*7.6in(25.5*25.5*19.5cm),easily pack 22 cans of 330 ml or 3-4 adults sized pre meal containers.This mens lunchbox for work also has 3 side pockts and 1 inner pockets. One front pocket of the mens lunch bag can pack your cellphone,charger and keys. Both side pockets have good elasticity. Right side pocket with an opening design is a perfect choice your napkin. Left side pocket can pack water bottle or umbrella. The inner mesh bag can fit your tableware and ice bags. [Tactical Design]This tactical lunch bag is a military tactical style. There is a tactical patch area in the front pocket. You can stick any style pactches you like. There is a strong tactical webbing behind cooler lunch box. You can put a small flashlight, sunglasses and tools on it. Durable double zipper is very smooth, and the opening of the lunch box is large, which is convenient for you to put things in or take out. A layer of rubber plate is added at the bottom, so that lunch bag men is not easy to deform even if it holds heavy things. [Easy to Carry]This work lunch box for men is equipped with adjustable and detachable straps, which can be carried by hand or use as a shoulder bag. In addition, the tote handle and strap of this big lunch box adult with sofe shoulder pads to reduce the load.It is very convenient to carry out. [Warranty]We focus on product quality and user experience. If you have any problems with this lunchbox for adults, please contact us and we will solve them for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719vl2PM85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gelugee","source_asin":"B09XGQSHD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGQSHD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGQSHD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
