window.products.push({"id":786296,"name":"Mary Square Still and Know Straw Tumbler, 24 oz, Floral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nwpO8FtaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customers are crazy about our best-selling Mary Square tumblers. Whether it’s a gift for a friend, for a loved one, or yourself, our straw top plastic insulated tumbler is the perfect pretty travel cup to hold your smoothie, water, juice, or iced tea to keep you going all day. These tumblers make an unbeatable gift and come in a variety of fun sentiments and custom-designed patterns. Our tumblers are made of double-walled, BPA-free plastic and are top-rack dishwasher safe. They have a reusable acrylic straw and a secure lid with a rubber gasket to keep your drinks from leaking or spilling. If you've been looking for an extra-trendy beverage holder to take with you throughout your day to carry your morning caffeinated drinks or to sip soda or water from while at work, look no further. Just pour 24 oz. of your favorite beverage, and you’re ready to go! Our tumbler fits most cup holders and is perfect for barbecues, home use, picnics, and the office.Year after year, Mary Square inspires women to celebrate life, have faith in who they are, and live life without regret. We are a community of women who encourage each other to be better and to value where we have come from. Creating inspiration is what we do. It is at the core of who we are and the \"why\" behind our brand. We work hard behind the scenes each day to bring you joy in the smallest things. Whether it is a piece of decor that reminds you that you are strong, a favorite dress that makes your confidence soar, an inspirational journal that helps you realize your dreams, or a heartfelt gift that you can give to a loved one, we are here for every season of your life. Whatever the day may hold, we empower you to create your journey, and we will be right here cheering you on along the way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nwpO8FtaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mary Square","source_asin":"B07HNGV1FW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNGV1FW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNGV1FW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
