window.products.push({"id":786398,"name":"Black Modern Genuine Slate Cheese Platter Tray Gourmet Board with Natural Edge for Cheese, Appetizer, Baked Goodies, Dry Fruits(8\" x 12\") Cutting Boar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mCwzAb4oL._AC_.jpg","description":"There'S Nothing More Captivating And Charming Than To Have The Rich, Black Finish Of This Slate Cutting Board Grace Your Counters And Tables Tops. It Provides An Earthy Foundation To Display Fresh Cheeses, Fruits And Vegetables, And Bread. The Slate Cutting Board Not Only Works As An Elegant Chopping Board Or Trivet, It Also Doubles As A Message Board Too. From Creating Doodles, Labeling Your Appetizers To Writing Sweet And Sincere Messages, This Chopping Board Comes Complete With A White Soap Stone Pencil To Let You Easily Write Directly On The Board. The Classic Design Fits In Perfectly For Both Everyday Dining And Formal Events. Fully Equipped With Felt, Corners Along The Back, It Provides A Stable Platform For Writing Messages And Chopping Ingredients.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mCwzAb4oL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOEY'Z","source_asin":"B08RLC9BJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RLC9BJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RLC9BJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":786399,"name":"MightyNest Plastic-Free Unscented Meliora Cleaning Products Dish & Hand Soap Bar and Natural Cedarwood Self Draining Soap Saver Tray Kitchen Set, Zero","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YB2qGQtAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ALL-NATURAL DISH WASHING SOAP – Say goodbye to dish soaps that can be harmful to the environment with this two-piece set for your kitchen sink from MightyNest. This bundle comes with one unscented soap bar and a convenient self-draining cedar wood tray to help your soap last longer. Plastic-free duo is great for the environment by keeping plastic bottles out of the landfill. DISH SOAP BAR – This dishwashing bar and cedar tray are plastic package free and a great addition to an eco-friendly lifestyle. Helps eliminate single-use plastics and toxins in your home. Also included is the cedarwood soap saver tray made from sustainably harvested wood; tray allows water to drain, extending the life of your bar soap. STRONG & CUTS GREASE – This concentrated formula dish soap bar cuts easily through grease and grime and lasts longer than traditional disposable dishwashing liquids. This plastic-free soap will wash your dirty dishes, pots, and pans with a rich lather that rinses off easily, even in cold water. GENTLE ON HANDS - Great for people with sensitive or dry skin, this non-irritant soap is made with all-natural ingredients such as coconut oil and sunflower seed oil so you can wash the dishes with your bare hands. The dish soap bar is also vegan, dye-free, preservative-free, and synthetic fragrance-free. SUSTAINABLE & SAFE – Mighty Nest ensures its products are safe for families to create a healthy home. Every product has been thoroughly researched to be free of concerning chemicals and hand-picked for you: no phthalates, no parabens and lead safe. Making healthy, green living simple and sustainable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YB2qGQtAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MightyNest","source_asin":"B09J987FDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J987FDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J987FDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
