window.products.push({"id":786471,"name":"Jokari Adjustable Crossbody Bottle Strap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71leTOiYNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're out for a day of sightseeing, headed for a stroll in the park or walking for exercise on your lunch hour, Jokari's clever crossbody bottle strap will keep you happily hands-free. The sturdy adjustable nylon strap has a maximum 24\" drop which can be shortened so suit your needs. And, the strap's durable plastic clip fits most bottled drinks; simply slide it onto the neck of the bottle and off you go! For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From their exclusive collection of Paula Deen storage and organization solutions to unique kitchen gadgets and Healthy Steps portion control kitchen tools, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, colorful and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71leTOiYNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B01N51URP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N51URP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N51URP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":786472,"name":"Royal Selangor Hand Finished Harry Potter Collection Pewter Hogwarts Music Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":210.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A3EIsY-aL._AC_SL1218_.jpg","description":"The narrow path had opened suddenly on to the edge of a great black lake. Perched atop a high mountain on the other side, its windows sparkling in the starry sky, was a vast castle with many turrets and towers.' No student of Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry ever forgets their first glimpse of the enormous Gothic-style castle. Our Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry Music Carousel and Trinket Box plays Hedwig's Theme plays when the lid is raised. A MUST HAVE gift for any Harry Potter Fan, this H15cm x 13cm x 13cm music Box can be used to store trinkets and small items. Every piece is meticulously hand-finished by our experienced craftspeople using traditional methods. Officially licensed merchandise made from high quality pewter with more than 100 years of craftmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A3EIsY-aL._AC_SL1218_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Selangor","source_asin":"B08MVQRQN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVQRQN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVQRQN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":786473,"name":"Tobbiheim 22.96 ft Globe String Lights 50 LED 8 Modes Waterproof Battery Operated Ball Fairy Light IP68 Battery Case with Remote and Timer for Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ysf4FsAEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"INTRODUCTIONS: ★This Tobbiheim warm white globe string light is made off 22.9ft silver wire and 2m leading wire, it include 50 led globes, the distance of two globes is 10cm.  ★The new 3 AA batteries can operate 48 hours in Steady mode.(Batteries not included) But we can offer free 2 CR2023 batteries with remote. ★The silver wire and led globe is low heat emission and safe to touch after many hours of usage. THE TOBBIHEIM BRAND CHARACTERISTICS ★A remote for Tobbiheim globe string lights: There are 13-key and 8 modes to remote control the globe string lights dim/brighten. You can also turn on/off it and change 8 modes by pressing the button on the box.  ★Tobbiheim timing function: To avoid forgetting to turn off the lights, you can set the timing with 6 hours on and 18 hours off per day. ★Tobbiheim durable battery base: Battery case is IP68 waterproof, with a control button to switch globe string lights mode. And use the hook on the top of the battery box to hang it on the wall. DECORATE INDOOR & OUTDOOR Great ideas for a colorful life. ★Put it above the flowers or gifts, and put them into the car trunk, giver your dear a pleasant surprise! ★Put it into your water fountain to create amazing water scenes. ★Decorate it in your courtyard, create a warm atmosphere. ★Pack it to your camping trip, adding more fun to your adventure. FUNCTION BUTTONS ON REMOTE: * ON/OFF: Turn on/off * -/+ : Adjust the brightness * 1-8: Switch modes * Timer: Timing Function, 6 hours on and 18 hours off per day SPECIFICATIONS: Length: 7M/22.9ft(including 2 meter power cable) Distance Between LEDs: 10cm Distance of Remote:3m LED Qty: 50pcs Wire Color: Silver Wire Power Supply: 3*AA battery (NOT INCLUDED) Waterproof Grade:IP68 Certification:CE, FCC, ROHS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ysf4FsAEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tobbiheim","source_asin":"B074TDZJPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074TDZJPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074TDZJPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
