window.products.push({"id":786489,"name":"JunVpic Cold Brew Coffee Maker Jar - 64oz Thick Glass Multipurpose Mason Pitcher Spout Lid with Handle & Stainless Steel Filter for Iced Brew Coffee, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aXjM3dV9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safety Glass Pitcher 】 - This beverage pitcher is made of heavy duty, food grade soda-lime glass that is thick, strong, and resistant to breaking. It is also dishwasher safe and lead, cadmium, and BPA free, ensuring it is safe and harmless for human use. Unlike plastic containers which can affect the taste of your drinks, this pitcher is a safe and healthy choice for storing your drinks. Its compact design makes it easy to store in the fridge 【Multi-Purpose Filters】- Filter is made of high-quality mesh that prevents coffee grounds from entering the pitcher jar, filters out large particles of coffee grounds to improve the taste of coffee, and can also be used to filter out fruit pits and tea leaves, making it easy to make iced tea and other beverages. Plus, you can take out the filter for storing or making other drinks 【Sturdy Sealing】 - Our liquid pitcher features a sturdy sealing system to keep your drinks fresh and prevent leakage. The leak-proof spout and sealing ring perfectly isolate the mason jar pour spout from the inside and outside, preventing food odors from affecting the taste. You can store your drinks with confidence, knowing that they will stay fresh and leak-free, even when the pitcher is lying down 【Easy to Clean】 - Cleaning the wide mouth jar is quick and easy. Simply put some mild soapy water into the used jar and shake to get rid of any residue. If the residue is stubborn due to a long time of use, you can even put your hand inside to clean it. With such easy cleaning, nothing can stop you from concocting a healthy and delicious drink 【Convenient Design】- The water jug is designed with convenience in mind. The flip lid won't fall down when pouring, making it easy to use without causing drips or splashes. The spout is designed to prevent leaks and keep everything clean. The ergonomically designed handle is sturdy and comfortable, able to withstand the weight of a full jug and easily shake settled juices to mix evenly. You won't have to worry about the handle being deformed or leaking","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aXjM3dV9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JunVpic","source_asin":"B0BSDGFGYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSDGFGYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSDGFGYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
