window.products.push({"id":786743,"name":"Bread Proofing Basket Set of 2 10 Inch Round Banneton Bread Proofing Baskets Proofing Basket Kit with liner cloth, dough scraper, bread scoring lame, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qpFKOHeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good for Proofing Bread: Every round bread proofing basket is made from rattan , that holds onto warmth for better proofing and is easy to clean. While bread is rising, this bread proving basket will impress the eye especially useful for free form boules and batards. Proof your bread before baking in this beautiful round rattan basket. Easy to Use: Comes with liner for a smooth top on your dough or just use the basket without a liner for a beautiful grooved texture on your loaf. Banneton proofing baskets are the traditional way to raise dough. Better rise resulting in a crunchier crust and texture after baking. No one can resist fresh bread straight from the oven. To Use a Banneton: Please suggest you coat the interior liberally with flour and make the dough not stick to the banneton. After use, gently shake out any loose flour and allow the basket time to dry. If any residues of dough are left in the basket, it is best to let them dry out, whereupon they can be picked off quite easily with a finger nail. Ideal Starter Set: Bread proving baskets of 2, liner cloth, top quality flexible dough scraper, bread scoring lame(The Bread Lame is very sharp, please use if carefully.),silicone basting brush , danish dough whisk and starter recipe . you will also get professional tips & tricks that are going to make you a better baker! Affordable And Great Gift:This bread proofing basket set is helpful for a baker and people who like to make fresh and healthy bread by themself. A housewife can make delicious for their little child and it will make much more funs to family.Also it's a good gift for friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qpFKOHeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOTEMIX","source_asin":"B0B7HT5CC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7HT5CC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7HT5CC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
