window.products.push({"id":786820,"name":"Anyana mini letters alphabet comma exclamation mark silicone mold Fondant Mould for gum paste tool Sugar paste supplies birthday cake decorating cupca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z-rqOTFKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Thank you for choosing my Silicone Cake Lace Mat product. Enjoy your baking time. My Silicone Cake Lace Mat is made of great design that makes beautiful detail cakes easily and quickly. It is flexible,durable and reusable silicone fondant imprint material that makes decorating of cake stressfree and fun filled for you. My Silicone Cake Lace Mat and molds can be wash using a mild soapy water or put it into dishwasher for easier and faster way, making it suitable and hygienic for fondant imprint. . Please be free to contact with us for any quality problem. Product Features: 1.High and low temperature resistance, good stability. Temperature range: -40 to +446 degrees fahrenheit 2. Non-toxic and environmental protection. Made of top natural silicone, non-toxic, conforms to the requirements of national standard. 3. Durability: excellent acid-proof, alkali resistance and corrosion resistance ability. It can be used repeatedly and long service life. Warning! 1.Clean it up with hot water for the first time. Do not use with abrasive cleaner or foam. 2.Don't bake the empty cups. You have to inject water into the empty cups before baking. 3. Must to spray oil before baking. 4. Silicon cups only can be used for the oven and microwave, it never can be directly used in the gas or electricity, or directly above or below the barbecue apparatus used in heating set. 5. Don't stress heavily, pull violently. 6. You'd better put it in carton, placed in the shade when you needn't it. 7.Don't rinse with cold water immediately when taking it out of the oven in order to prolong the service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z-rqOTFKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anyana","source_asin":"B017AW52QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017AW52QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017AW52QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
