window.products.push({"id":786836,"name":"Juvale Gingerbread Man Tablecloth for Christmas Party (54 x 108 in, 6 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MexTY6f4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the holiday festivities right to your home thanks to this set of 6 colorful gingerbread man tablecloths. Each table cover is made with a thick, material that is easy to set up and looks great on just about any rectangle table. This set of table covers feature cute candy canes, candy, and smiling gingerbread men and women that are sure to make any Christmas dinner or family gathering feel more festive and special. No more worrying about kids spilling drinks during the Christmas party or making a mess while doing arts and crafts or building gingerbread houses. Simply toss the table cloth out after use and spend less time cleaning up and more time enjoying the holiday party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MexTY6f4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juvale","source_asin":"B07DWMYT3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DWMYT3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DWMYT3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
