window.products.push({"id":786959,"name":"MIULEE Set of 2 Non Slip Shaggy Bathroom Rugs Extra Thick Soft Bath Mats Plush Microfiber Absorbent Water for Tub Shower Machine Washable (Cream White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gtJJOeZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTREMELY SOFT MATERIAL: These bathroom mats are made of fluffy, soft microfiber stitched together to soothe your tired feet after a hard day and keep you away from the cold floor. The fabric of this bathroom rug mat is very soft. When you step on it barefoot, you will feel very soft. At the same time, our bathroom mat is not easy to shed hair even if it is pulled. The quality won't let you down. ULTRA ABSORBENT：When you step out of your shower, you will be amazed at how it soaks up water really well. This fluffy microfiber fabric has dense pores, which can absorb water more quickly and greatly than ordinary bath mats, and instantly separate dry and wet. NON SLIP BACKING: Using new high quality TPR at the bottom which fit the floor well and not easy to slide. Our bath mats are non slip and wear-resistant, it is not easy to fall down when you use them. REMINDER: Please place the mat on a clean, dry, smooth floor. Before using the mat, test it with your feet to make sure it doesn't move. MACHINE-WASH: Super soft microfiber and TPR material at the bottom are designed to be machine washable to remove stains. For best results, wash in cold water and dry gently over low heat. MULTIPLE ROLES：Our luxurious microfiber shaggy bathroom mats could protect your toes from the cold floor, comfortable and warm, suitable for bathroom, entrance, stairway, kitchen. MIULEE YOUR HOME YOUR WAY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gtJJOeZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIULEE","source_asin":"B09249BV4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09249BV4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09249BV4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":786960,"name":"Brielle 100-Percent MicroModal from Beech Premium Sateen Sheet Set, King, Taupe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOxMhN+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brielle Sateen Modal Sheets offer a soft touch and sheen. What is Brielle? Brielle? is our exclusive home textiles brand. In Brielle? we distilled 60 years of expertise to deliver the best value in home textiles. We carry an extensive selection of bedding products with cotton, modal, tencel / lyocell, bamboo fibers in sateen jersey, twill, and percale weaves. The selection of fabric, size and color options often are not offered by local stores and delivered to your door at your convenience. We also carry a wide selection of window panels. Whether you are shopping for a sheet set, window panels or bathrobe, Brielle? will deliver the best product for your money. Luxury bedding and home textiles for factory prices. Guaranteed. What is Modal? This bedding product is made of Modal which is a high strength fiber, famous for its silky softness. Modal has a refined smooth touch, excellent breathability and moisture management features. We used the Lensing Modal?, Austrian produced Modal fiber, made of the natural cellulose from Beech wood trees of Europe. Lensing Modal is manufactured with high sustainability and ecological standards. Austrians are known for their fancy high tech sport cars and idyllic mountain scenes. They did not fall short in the glamour department with this marvelous fiber. What is Sateen? Sateen is a type of weave incorporating more vertical than horizontal yarns, which results in an extremely soft fabric with a silky sheen. Sateen is a luxurious and eye-catching weave. Search Brielle sheets for different softness, durability, and price options. We have something for every taste and budget.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOxMhN+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brielle Home","source_asin":"B00LNHUZZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LNHUZZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LNHUZZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
