window.products.push({"id":786979,"name":"Glad 14-Piece Pakkawood Knife Set – Stainless Steel Cutlery with Wood Block Stand | Professional Quality, High Carbon, Satin Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knei8semL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enhance your cooking experience with this 14-Piece Knife Set from Glad. This all-in-one complete set includes every tool needed for chopping, dicing and cutting foods ranging from fruits and veggies to meats and cheeses.14-PIECE SET INCLUDES – Six 4.5-inch steak knives, 8-inch chef knife, 8-inch carving knife, 8-inch bread knife, 5-inch utility knife, 4-inch paring knife, kitchen shears and a sharpening steel all secured within a space-saving wooden block holder.Product Details:• CHEF KNIFE (8 inches) – For chopping, dicing and slicing.• CARVING KNIFE (8 inches) – Good for carving roasts, fowls, fruits and vegetables.• BREAD KNIFE (8 inches) – Cuts through thick and chewy crusts without crushing the interior.• UTILITY KNIFE (5 inches) – For slicing fruit, cheese and most everyday use.• PARING KNIFE (4 inches) – Great for paring, peeling and slicing small fruits and vegetables.• STEAK KNIVES, 6 PIECES (4.5 inches) – For cutting steaks and roasts.• KITCHEN SHEARS – Great tool for kitchen or household. Includes screw cap opener in handle and bottle opener notch in the blade.• SHARPENING STEEL – Use regularly to keep knives sharp.• WOOD STORAGE BLOCK – Includes slots designated to protect and secure each tool and rubber bottom grips for counter top stability.• High-carbon stainless steel• Professional quality• Laser-sharp edges for clean, precise cuts every time• Knives have triple riveted pakkawood handles• Full tang for strength, durability and control• Bolster finger guard• Rust, stain and corrosion resistant","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knei8semL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glad","source_asin":"B07GYB23LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-786979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GYB23LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GYB23LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
